    "press.page.caption.hero": "His Imperial Majesty Emperor Maximilian II leads the Imperial cortège into the Grand Ballroom of the Hofburg, followed by Crown Prince Leopold von Habsburg and Fräulein Katharina von Richter · Hofburg Palace, Vienna · January 2026",
